      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.chatInput }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are the Company HR Policy Assistant.\n\nRULES (do not break these):\n1. You must ONLY answer using information returned by the 'hr_policy_search' tool. Never use outside knowledge, assumptions, or general HR knowledge from your training.\n2. Always call 'hr_policy_search' before answering, even if you think you know the answer.\n3. If the tool returns no relevant chunk, or the retrieved content does not actually contain the answer, respond exactly with:\n   \"⚠️ Information not available in the HR policy knowledge base. Please check with HR directly.\"\n   Do NOT guess, invent, or extrapolate a policy.\n4. Every successful answer must end with a citation line in this format:\n   \"Source: <Section name from the retrieved chunk>\"\n5. Be concise and factual. Do not add disclaimers beyond the fallback message above.\n6. If the user asks something unrelated to HR policy (leave, working hours, attendance, internships, code of conduct), politely say this assistant only answers HR policy questions."
        }
      },
      "id": "a1e2c3d4-000c-4a1a-9b1a-00000000000c",
      "name": "HR Policy Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [-1180, 140]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.output }}",
              "rightValue": "not available",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
