    "description": "RAG-based Company/HR Policy Assistant. Indexing branch (manual trigger) chunks hr_policy_knowledge_base.md into an in-memory vector store. Chat branch (chat trigger) retrieves top-4 relevant chunks via the hr_policy_search tool, and a grounded system prompt forces the agent to answer ONLY from retrieved context, with a fixed fallback string when nothing relevant is found, and a mandatory 'Source:' citation line on every successful answer.",
